---
// Tri-Phase Approach & Method Component - Nexus Fitness Court
---

<section id="approach" class="approach-section" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
  <div class="container approach-grid">
    <!-- Left Column: Strategy & Guarantee -->
    <div class="approach-intro">
      <div class="badge-nexus">
        THE NEXUS METHOD
      </div>

      <h2 id="approach-heading" class="approach-title">
        YOUR PATH TO A STRONGER, LEANER YOU — <span class="text-nexus">SIMPLIFIED.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="approach-desc">
        Say goodbye to cookie-cutter workouts and starvation diets. At <strong>Nexus Fitness Court</strong>, our structured training system combines progressive overload on commercial Gymquip plate-loaded stations with practical, high-protein nutrition to deliver sustainable physical results.
      </p>

      <div class="guarantee-box glass-card">
        <div class="guarantee-header">
          <div class="guarantee-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="guarantee-title">100% Results Commitment</h3>
            <span class="guarantee-subtitle">Besa's Premier Fitness Philosophy</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="guarantee-text">
          Follow our tailored workout split and nutrition guidelines for 90 days. If you don't experience visible reduction in body fat, improved posture, and measurable strength gains, our certified trainers work with you 1-on-1 for free until you hit your benchmark.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Interactive Step Cards -->
    <div class="steps-stack">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <article class="step-card glass-card">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-num-badge">STEP 01</div>
          <span class="step-timing">DAY 1</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Biomechanical Intake & Movement Assessment</h3>
        <p class="step-body">
          We evaluate your shoulder mobility, squat mechanics, core stability, and baseline body composition right on our gym floor at Om Enclave, Besa Road.
        </p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span class="step-tag">Mobility Assessment</span>
          <span class="step-tag">Posture Check</span>
          <span class="step-tag">Goal Roadmap</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Step 2: Featured / Active State in Volt Gold -->
      <article class="step-card glass-card step-card-featured">
        <div class="featured-indicator"></div>
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-num-badge step-featured-badge">STEP 02</div>
          <span class="step-timing featured-timing">EXECUTION</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Custom Nexus Split + Nutrition Blueprint</h3>
        <p class="step-body">
          You receive a structured progressive overload routine utilizing our Gymquip pin/plate-loaded stations, cardio deck, and free weights, paired with easy Indian meal targets.
        </p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span class="step-tag tag-primary">Hypertrophy Split</span>
          <span class="step-tag tag-primary">High-Protein Meal Chart</span>
          <span class="step-tag tag-primary">Form Guidance</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <article class="step-card glass-card">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-num-badge">STEP 03</div>
          <span class="step-timing">ONGOING</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Continuous Progression & Weekly Calibration</h3>
        <p class="step-body">
          Our on-floor trainers monitor your lifting weights, reps, and measurements every week to guarantee you never plateau or risk unnecessary joint strain.
        </p>
        <div class="step-tags">
          <span class="step-tag">WhatsApp Coach Support</span>
          <span class="step-tag">Weight Calibration</span>
          <span class="step-tag">Fat Loss Tracking</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .approach-section {
    padding: 6.5rem 0;
    position: relative;
    background: #090a0f;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1.15fr;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
  }

  .approach-title {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .approach-title {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
    }
  }

  .approach-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .approach-desc strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Guarantee Box */
  .guarantee-box {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.05) 0%, rgba(18, 19, 26, 0.8) 100%);
  }
  .guarantee-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .guarantee-icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-nexus);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .guarantee-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }
  .guarantee-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .guarantee-text {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* Step Cards Stack */
  .steps-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    position: relative;
    transition: all var(--transition-smooth);
  }
  .step-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: var(--border-medium);
  }

  .step-card-featured {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181b24 0%, #12131b 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 35px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.18);
  }
  .step-card-featured:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 45px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.28);
  }

  .featured-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--primary), transparent);
  }

  .step-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .step-num-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .step-featured-badge {
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.18);
    color: var(--primary);
    border-color: var(--border-nexus);
  }
  .step-timing {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .featured-timing {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .step-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .step-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .tag-primary {
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.35);
    color: var(--primary);
  }
</style>
